tyle="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Laterne:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">5.1301/EN-GJL-250</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einbaumaße</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Saugseitiger Rohranschluss: DN 80 , PN 16</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Druckseitiger Rohranschluss: DN 65 , PN 16</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Hersteller Pumpe:	</span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'.........................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:75px 124px 151px 183px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 680px 756px 831px 907px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(Wilo oder gleichwertig)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">[PERSON_129] Pumpe:	</span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'.........................................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:113px 151px 183px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 680px 756px 831px 907px 982px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(z. B. </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Atmos GIGA-B 65/150-1,5/4 oder</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:113px 151px 183px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 680px 756px 831px 907px 982px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">gleichwertig)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dem Angebot ist ein aussagekräftiges Datenblatt der angebotenen Pumpe mit allen relevanten Angaben zu Betriebsdaten, Pumpenhydraulik, Antrieb, Wirkungsgrad und Werkstoffen beizulegen!</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Pumpe liefern und betriebsfertig montieren.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">[PERSON_090] / [PERSON_066]</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id385" RNoPart="2"><Qty>4.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Pumpe gemäß vorstehender Position (Zwischendruckerhöhung Entarsenierungsfilter und [PERSON_066]) ist vor Herstellung des Betonfundaments für die Pumpe zu installieren.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anzubieten ist ein stabiles Untergestell aus Stahlprofilen / Gewindestangen nach [PERSON_125] des Bieters für die Montage der Pumpe 30 cm über Fussboden, geeignet zum nachträglichen Ausgießen mit Beton.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Lagesicherung durch Andübeln am Betonboden.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">[PERSON_092]</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id225" RNoPart="3"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Trockenläufer-Blockpumpe</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einstufige [PERSON_054] in [PERSON_185]-Bauform für</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fundamentaufstellung inklusive Fuß am Pumpengehäuse.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schwingungs- und geräuscharme Blockbauart mit Laterne und</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">starr verbundenem Standardmotor (Norm-Motor).</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mit zwangsumfluteter, drehrichtungsunabhängiger Faltenbalg-</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gleitringdichtung (ab 37 kW/4-polig optional mit einer Cartridge-Gleitringdichtung in Back-Pull-Out-System zum</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gleitringdichtungsaustausch ohne Demontage des Motors) und</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">kavitationsreduzierendem Laufrad.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Flansche mit Druckmessanschlüssen R 1/8. Alle</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Graugusskomponenten sind kataphoresebeschichtet.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Pumpen mit Motoren &gt; 5,5 kW verfügen serienmäßig über</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kaltleiterfühler als Motorschutz.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Der Motorklemmkasten &lt; 7,5 kW kann aus Metall oder Kunststoff sein. Die Motorklemmkästen &gt; 7,5 kW sind immer aus Metall.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Gleitringdichtung für die Wasserförderung bis Tmax. = + 140°C.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Betriebsdaten</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:75px 151px 183px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 680px 756px 831px 907px 982px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Fördermedium: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Trinkwasser 100 %</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:75px 151px 183px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 680px 756px 831px 907px 982px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Medientemperatur:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">10 - 20,00 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:75px 151px 183px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 680px 756px 831px 907px 982px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Angefragter [PERSON_094]:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">21,00 m 3 /h</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:75px 151px 183px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 680px 756px 831px 907px 982px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Angefragte Förderhöhe:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">38,00 m</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:75px 151px 183px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 680px 756px 831px 907px 982px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Min. Medientemperatur:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count