</p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">für Entleerungen an Rohrleitungsenden mit Blindflansch,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mat: 1.4571,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einschließlich Bohrung in Blindflansch DN 100 - 200, PN 10</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und Schweißnaht,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">sohlgleich zur Rohrleitung eingebaut,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">gebeizt und passiviert.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Als Zulage zur Flansch-Position DN 100 - DN 200.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">liefern und montieren</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anschweissmuffe 2 Zoll, Einbau in Blindflansch PN 10</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id311" RNoPart="60"><Qty>10.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wandblende für Kernbohrungen / Rohrleitungswanddurchführungen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Durchmesser Kernbohrung/Futterrohr:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">150 bis 200 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Außendurchmesser Medienrohr:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">63 bis 80 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">zum optisch ansprechenden Verblenden von Mauerdurchführungen (Stahlbeton-[PERSON_074])</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zweiteilig, als Halbkreis, ausgeführt,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit Befestigungsbohrungen zur Wandbefestigung,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Überdeckung der Kernbohrung/des Futterrohres umlaufend ca. 40 mm,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Abstand zum Medienrohr umlaufend max. 3 mm,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">inkl. allem erforderlichen Montagematerial,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Werkstoff: 1.4301</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">liefern und montieren</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wandblende für Wanddurchführungen bis D 200 mm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id312" RNoPart="61"><Qty>5.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wandblende für Kernbohrungen / Rohrleitungswanddurchführungen wie vor, jedoch</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Durchmesser Kernbohrung/Futterrohr:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">250 bis 300 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Außendurchmesser Medienrohr:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">168 bis 200 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">liefern und montieren</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wandblende für Wanddurchführungen bis D 300 mm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id313" RNoPart="62"><Qty>5.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wandblende für Kernbohrungen / Rohrleitungswanddurchführungen wie vor, jedoch</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Durchmesser Kernbohrung/Futterrohr:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">350 bis 400 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Außendurchmesser Medienrohr:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">250 bis 300 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">liefern und montieren</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wandblende für Wanddurchführungen bis D 400 mm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id314" RNoPart="63"><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Siphon DN 200 in [PERSON_115] 1.4571,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit Sperrwasservorlage, als geruchs- und gasdichter, flüssigkeitsdurchlässiger Verschluss zum Beispiel von Übereichleitungen,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">zum vertikalen Einbau,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ausführung als FF-Stück PN 10 mit zwischengebautem Siphon,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gesamthöhe 1000 mm,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit seitlich angebrachtem PVC-Rohranzeiger zur Kontrolle der Sperrwasserhöhe,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit Absperrventilen zum Befüllen und Enleeren des Siphons.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Herstellter:	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'.................................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:18px 37px 75px 113px 151px 189px 226px 264px 302px 340px 378px 415px 453px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(z. B. Glogger, Augsburg oder gleichwertig)</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Siphon DN 200 in vertikaler Bauart</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item></Itemlist></BoQBody></BoQCtgy><BoQCtgy ID="id315" RNoPart="02"><LblTx><p><span>Kleinleitungen aus nichtrostenden [PERSON_089]</span></p></LblTx><BoQBody><Itemlist><Remark ID="id316"><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kleinleitungen aus nichtrostendem Stahl</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Sämtliche erforderlichen Kleinleitungen kleiner/gleich</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 65;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">komplett aus nichtrostendem [PERSON_089] mit Schraub- bzw.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Preßfittingverbindungen;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einschließlich</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">aller Verbindungs- und Formstücke und erforderlichen Anschluss-/Ausbaustücke für Einbauten, Zubehör etc. aus nichtrostendem [PERSON_089] (alle Einbauten müssen leicht demontierbar sein/Verschraubung oder Gewindeflansch);</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">chloridfreier/-armer ozonbeständiger Dichtungsmaterialien;</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wandbefestigungen.</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Allgemeine Hinweise zur Berohrung:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Das Biegen der Rohre ist unzulässig. Übergangsstücke aus nichtrostendem [PERSON_089]. Bei Übergang auf Messingarmaturen bzw. sonstige Ausrüstungsteile aus [PERSON_176] oder unlegierten oder niedriglegierten [PERSON_089] können auch Rotgussverbindungsstücke verwendet werden.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fabrikat:	</span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'.....................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:75px 151px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 680px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(z.B. mapress oder gleichwertig)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Druckstufe: PN 16</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kleinleitungen aus nichtrostendem [PERSON_089]</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Remark><Item ID="id317" RNoPart="1"><Qty>100.000</Qty><QU>m</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Pressfitting-Rohrleitung DN 15 PN 10/16</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">18 x 1 mm, Werkstoff 1.4401,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einschließlich aller zur Montage nötigen Verbindungs-, Formteile, Verschraubungen etc. und Halterungen aus mind. 1.4301 mit Gummieinlage.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">liefern und montieren</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kleinleitungen DN 15</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id318" RNoPart="2"><Qty>5.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zulage zu vorgenannter Pressfitting-Rohrleitung DN 15</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">für die Ausbildung eines Siphon (4 mal Bogen 90 Grad + ca. 50 cm Rohr) für Kondensatabläufe von Luftfiltern,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Sperrwasserhöhe in Siphon mindestens 8 cm,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einschließlich in das Siphon integriertes Schauglas zur Sichtkontrolle der Wasserfüllung,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">z. B. Fergo Schauglas [PERSON_129] GD100-SSTXI-1/2"</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gewinde nach ISO 7-1 (EN 10226-1), F-F</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gehäuse: 1.4408 (CF8M), kugelgestrahlt</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Glas: Kalknatron-Hartglas</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dichtung: PTFE</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Betriebstemperatur: max. 240°C bei 10 bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Max. Betriebsdruck: 10 bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">oder gleichwertig.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Absperr-Kugelhähne sind in separater Position enthalten.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Siphon aus Kleinleitung DN 15 mit Schauglas</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id319" RNoPart="3"><Qty>10.000</Qty><QU>m</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Pressfitting-Rohrleitung DN 20 PN 10/16</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">22 x 1,2 mm, Werkstoff 1.4401,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einschließlich aller zur Montage nötigen, Verbindungs-, Formteile, Verschraubungen etc. und Halterungen aus mind. 1.4301 mit Gummieinlage.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">liefern und montieren</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"