abdichtung mit dreifacher O-Ring Abdichtung;</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Keilführung im Gehäuse und langer Spindellagerung</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gehäuse: Duktiles Gusseisen EN-GJS-400-15 (GGG-40)</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Deckel: Duktiles Gusseisen EN-GJS-400-15 (GGG-40)</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Absperrkeil: Duktiles Gusseisen EN-GJS-400-15 (GGG-40) allseitig mit EPDM vulkanisiert</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Deckelschrauben: [PERSON_115] A2 (DIN EN ISO 3506)</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Spindel: [PERSON_115] 1.4057</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Spindelmutter: Messing</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Korrosionsschutz: Innen und außen Epoxid-Beschichtung nach GSK-Richtlinien</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dichtheit nach DIN EN 12 266-1, Leckrate A;</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">alle mediumberührten Teile nach KTW und DVGW Arbeitsblatt W270 (bakteriologisch unbedenklich)</span></p><