lTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Weichdichtender Absperrschieber nach EN 1074</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit Elektroantrieb</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial;">Absperrarmatur für Trinkwasser</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> bis 50°C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 40 - 600, PN 10 - 16</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"/><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Weichdichtend nach EN 1074 (DIN 3352-4B),</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Baulänge DIN EN 558-1, Grundreihe 14 (DIN 3202, F4).</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Beiderseits </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial;">Flanschanschluss nach EN 1092-1, PN 16</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">, sofern in nachstehenden Positionstexten nicht anders angegeben.</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wartungsfreie und korrosionssichere verlängerte Spindelabdichtung mit dreifacher O-Ring Abdichtung;</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Keilführung im Gehäuse und langer Spindellagerung</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gehäuse: Duktiles Gusseisen EN-GJS-400-15 (GGG-40)</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Deckel: Duktiles Gusseisen EN-GJS-400-15 (GGG-40)</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Absperrkeil: Duktiles Gusseisen EN-GJS-400-15 (GGG-40) allseitig mit EPDM vulkanisiert</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Deckelschrauben: [PERSON_115] A2 (DIN EN ISO 3506)</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Spindel: [PERSON_115] 1.4057</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Spindelmutter: Messing</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Korrosionsschutz: Innen und außen Epoxid-Beschichtung nach GSK-Richtlinien</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DVGW-geprüft und registriert</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ausführung mit angebautem</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial;">Elektroantrieb AUMA-Drehantrieb</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> (Stellbetrieb) oder gleichwertig</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Betriebsart: S2 - 15 min</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Netzspannung: Drehstrom 400 V / 50 Hz</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Stellzeit / Antrieb (bei gleichwertigen Antrieben anderer Hersteller Datenblatt beilegen):</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 50: 34 Sekunden / Antriebsgröße SA 07.6</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 65: 48 Sekunden / Antriebsgröße SA 07.6</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 80: 55 Sekunden / Antriebsgröße SA 07.6</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 100: 55 Sekunden / Antriebsgröße SA 07.6</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 125: 68 Sekunden / Antriebsgröße SA 10.2</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 150: 82 Sekunden / Antriebsgröße SA 10.2</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 200: 93 Sekunden / Antriebsgröße SA 10.2</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Antrieb mit</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Heizung im Schaltwerkraum: 110 V bis 250 V</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Elektroanschluss - Steckerdeckel: mit M-Gewinden (1 x M20x1 ,5 / 1 x M25x1 ,5</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 x M32x1 ,5)</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Temperatur-Ausführung: Standard -30°C bis +70°C</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schutzklasse: IP68</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Korrosionsschutz: KS</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mechanische Stellungsanzeige</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Blinkgeber</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Fabrikat:	</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'.........................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:112px 151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px;">