:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">C-Storzkupplung 2 Zoll</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mat: Niro, mit Außengewinde, Blinddeckel und Kette</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">liefern und montieren</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Storz-C-Kupplung (Niro)</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id363" RNoPart="9"><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">B-Storzkupplung 3 Zoll</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mat: Niro, mit Außengewinde, Blinddeckel und Kette</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">liefern und montieren</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Storz-B-Kupplung (Niro)</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id364" RNoPart="10"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Magnetventil 2" servogesteuert mit 230 Volt Spule</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Für den Einsatz im Trinkwasserbereich,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Stromlos geschlossen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Der angegebene Mindestdruck muss als Differenzdruck für eine einwandfreie Funktion der Servosteuerung immer vorhanden sein</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einbaulage: beliebig</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dichtung: mit Trinkwasserzulassung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Medientemperatur: -10°C bis +80°C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mit Magnetspule und Gerätestecker</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Spannung: 230 Volt, 50 Hz</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schutzart: IP65</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schnell schließend</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zulässiger Druck: 0,3 - 20 bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mit min. 0,3 bar Druckdifferenz arbeitend</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ventil in Ruhestellung geschlossen (NC). Bei Bestromung öffnet die Magnetspule die Vorsteuerbohrung und es baut sich der Druck auf der Oberseite der Membrane ab. Der nun höhere Druck unter der Membrane hebt diese vom Ventilsitz ab. Der angegebene Mindestdruck muss als Druckdifferenz immer vorhanden sein.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Größe:DN 50 (2")</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Hersteller:	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'...........................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:18px 37px 75px 113px 151px 189px 226px 264px 302px 340px 378px 415px 453px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(z. B. GSR oder gleichwertig)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">[PERSON_129]:		 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'...........................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:18px 37px 75px 113px 151px 189px 226px 264px 302px 340px 378px 415px 453px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anschluss R innen:DN 50 (2")</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Magnetventil DN 50</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id365" RNoPart="11"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Probenahmebecken aus nichtrostendem [PERSON_089] (1.4571)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit leicht schräg ausgebildetem Boden;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit 6 Stück Probenahmeventilen DN 15, abflammbar, mit</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anschlussnippel G 1/2 Zoll, Ausführung in [PERSON_115],</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fabrikat / [PERSON_129]: Elomat PROHA 1 oder gleichwertig</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Beschriftung je Probenahme mit graviertem [PERSON_013] (z. B. Resopalschild),</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit rückseitigem Blech zur Montage der Probenahmeventile; </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">als Spritzschutz: </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Abdecksieb für Beckenfläche und seitliche Schutzbleche;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">inkl. Leitungsanschluß DN 50 im Boden aus Niro für Anschluss an Ablaufleitung DN 50 (Pressfittingrohrleitung)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Vorbereitet für Montage an Stahlbetonwand oder verputzter Ziegelwand inkl. Wandkonsolen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Beckentiefe:		 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><