family:Arial;">(Mankenberg oder gleichwertig)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">[PERSON_129]:	</span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'.......................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:75px 113px 151px 188px 226px 265px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 680px 756px 831px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(EB 1.12 3/4 x 1/2 oder gleichwertig)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">liefern und betriebsfertig montieren</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Be-/Entlüfter G 3/4 x 1/2, PN 10</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item></Itemlist></BoQBody></BoQCtgy></BoQBody></BoQCtgy><BoQCtgy ID="id377" RNoPart="07"><LblTx><p><span>Zentrale Zu- und Abluftsysteme für Wasserkammern</span></p></LblTx><BoQBody><BoQCtgy ID="id378" RNoPart="01"><LblTx><p><span>Zu-/Abluft Reinwasertanks</span></p></LblTx><BoQBody><Itemlist><Item ID="id379" RNoPart="1"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Luftfilteranlage aus [PERSON_115] WSt.-Nr. 1.4571,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">beidseitig rnit Rohranschlüssen und ggf. Reduzierung derselben auf DN 150 (siehe Hinweis weiter unten!), Spitzende,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Luftdurchsatz inkl. Reserve mindestens 250 m3 pro Stunde.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mit abnehmbarem Deckel als Wartungsöffnung der Filter,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">alle Filterelemente leicht kontrollierbar und auswechselbar,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Berstdruck der Filter 800 Pa,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kondenswasserablauf für Frisch- und Reinluftseite mit 1/2-Zoll AG, für den bauseitigen Anschluss an eine Entleerungsleitung,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einschl.</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Differenzdruckmesser mit örtlicher LCD-Anzeige und potentialfreiem Anschlusskontakt zum bauseitigen Anschluss an die Prozessleittechnik (Übertragung von aktuellem Differenzdruck), einschließlich der erforderlcihen Anschlüsse vor/nach der Filtereinheit im Filtergehäuse</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Luftfilter:</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 St. Feinstaubfilter F7 nach EN 779, Abscheidegrad &gt; 90 %</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 St. Schwebstofffilter H13 nach EN 779, Abscheidegrad &gt; 99,95 %</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einschl. Dokumentation für Luftfilteranlage</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einschl.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wandkonsolen zu angebotener [PERSON_162]:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Winkel 50/50, Länge 450/400 mm,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">lichter Wandabstand 50 bis 100 mm,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit Befestigungsmaterial</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die beidseits anzuschließende Luftleitung wird in Nennweite DN 150 ausgeführt. Wenn die Anschlüsse der [PERSON_162] eine davon abweichende Nennweite haben, ist die beidseitige Reduzierung der Rohrleitung auf DN 150 in die Position einzurechnen!</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Angebotenes Fabrikat:	 </span></p></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption/><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'...........................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(Elementbau Glogger, [FIRMA_062] oder</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">gleichwertig)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">angebotener [PERSON_129]:	</span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'...........................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="13" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font